  "material": true,
  "note": "Stated as fact; it is the host's account (24:14 'Marina Minas, the chief marketing officer, personally called Aubrey at 2:05'). Transcript says Minas, not Medvin (ruled N-494 = Marina Minas). Aubrey (N-552) named but not in Mentions.",
  "fix": {
   "claim": "The host says that at 2:05 p.m. Utah time on Sept 10, Marina Minas, the chief marketing officer, called Aubrey and asked her to draft the staff death statement because Andrew was on a plane.",
   "label": "Host Says Marina Minas Routed Death-Statement Drafting to Aubrey Citing Andrew's Plane Status",
   "mentions": [
    "N-494",
    "N-552",
    "N-14"
   ],
   "names": [
    {
     "wrong": "Marina Medvin",
     "right": "Marina Minas",
     "source": "https://people.equilar.com/bio/person/marina-minas-turning-point-usa/70724078"
    }
   ]
  }
 },
